* On the first visit the page shows a **cookie notice** with categories: technically necessary, settings (local), external only after consent. There is **no tracking** and **no external fonts**.

* The admin can switch the notice off in the [[Settings]].
* Under `/legal-notice` there is a legal notice with its own Markdown text (HTML is escaped); it is linked in the footer of the start page and the admin app.
* **"Cookie settings"** in the footer lets you change the choice at any time.